<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>Day 48 - Health Actions 🏃</title>
<link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@picocss/pico@2/css/pico.min.css">
<style>
body{margin:0;font-family:'Segoe UI',system-ui,sans-serif;background:linear-gradient(to bottom,#fff9dc,#fffacd);text-align:center;}
.star{position:absolute;width:2px;height:2px;background:white;border-radius:50%;opacity:0;animation:twinkle 3s infinite;}
@keyframes twinkle{0%,100%{opacity:0;}50%{opacity:1;}}
.stars-container{position:fixed;width:100%;height:100%;z-index:0;}
main{position:relative;z-index:2;}
.highlight{font-size:2rem;font-weight:bold;margin:20px auto;max-width:700px;padding:20px;border-radius:20px;background:rgba(255,250,200,0.85);}
.verse{font-style:italic;margin:25px auto;max-width:800px;background:white;padding:25px;border-radius:20px;}
.vocab-box{background:white;padding:15px;margin:10px auto;max-width:850px;text-align:left;border-left:6px solid gold;border-radius:10px;}
.vocab-word{font-weight:bold;color:#c0392b;}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="stars-container"></div>
<main class="container">
<h1>Day 48 🌟</h1>

<div class="highlight">
Health Actions 🏃<br>
<span style="font-size:1.3rem;">স্বাস্থ্য সম্পর্কিত ক্রিয়া 🌟</span>
</div>

<div class="verse">
“But those who hope in the Lord will renew their strength.”<br>
<strong>Isaiah 40:31 🙏</strong>
</div>

<div class="vocab-box"><span class="vocab-word">Breathe</span> – শ্বাস নেওয়া<br><i>Breathe slowly.</i></div>
<div class="vocab-box"><span class="vocab-word">Stretch</span> – প্রসারিত করা<br><i>Stretch your arms.</i></div>
<div class="vocab-box"><span class="vocab-word">Lift</span> – তোলা<br><i>Lift the box carefully.</i></div>
<div class="vocab-box"><span class="vocab-word">Carry</span> – বহন করা<br><i>Carry your bag.</i></div>
<div class="vocab-box"><span class="vocab-word">Push</span> – ঠেলা<br><i>Push the door.</i></div>
<div class="vocab-box"><span class="vocab-word">Pull</span> – টানা<br><i>Pull the rope.</i></div>
<div class="vocab-box"><span class="vocab-word">Bend</span> – বাঁকানো<br><i>Bend your knees.</i></div>
<div class="vocab-box"><span class="vocab-word">Cough</span> – কাশি দেওয়া<br><i>He coughs loudly.</i></div>
<div class="vocab-box"><span class="vocab-word">Sneeze</span> – হাঁচি দেওয়া<br><i>She sneezed suddenly.</i></div>
<div class="vocab-box"><span class="vocab-word">Recover</span> – সেরে ওঠা<br><i>He recovered quickly.</i></div>

<footer>© 2026 Tatzliach Education ⭐</footer>
</main>

<script>
const container=document.querySelector('.stars-container');
for(let i=0;i<50;i++){
let star=document.createElement('div');
star.classList.add('star');
star.style.top=Math.random()*100+'%';
star.style.left=Math.random()*100+'%';
container.appendChild(star);
}
</script>
</body>
</html>
